<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seoul finance minister to unveil ecomomic policies.</title>
<headline>Seoul finance minister to unveil ecomomic policies.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korean Finance and Economic Minister Han Seung-soo will announce new economic policies on Tuesday, a ministry spokesman said on Monday.</p>
<p>But he declined to give details on what the new policies would contain.</p>
</text>
